<</Alt(A clean, modern professional infographic diagram visualizing a 'Collaboration-Driven Growth Loop' tailored for FinWise Co., a SaaS financial management software for small businesses. The diagram uses a color palette of professional blues, deep oranges, an\
d clean greens, featuring friendly vector illustrations and clear typography. The structure is a continuous, circulating loop. The central hub is labeled 'FINWISE CO. COLLABORATION-DRIVEN GROWTH LOOP' with a small gear icon. The loop connects four main st\
ages. Stage 1 \(Start/Trigger\): An icon of a small business owner. Text: 'TRIGGER: Trial User Starts Accounting Setup'. A small thought bubble says, 'Need help with reporting!' A prominent arrow points to the next stage. Stage 2 \(Action\): An icon showi\
ng two people \(Owner and an Accountant/Collaborator\) working together at a desk with a laptop displaying charts. Text: 'ACTION: Owner Invites Accountant/Bookkeeper to Trial'. An orange tag emphasizes, 'Free Collaborator Seat'. Stage 3 \(Value\): An icon\
 of a completed, audited balance sheet and green up-arrows. Text: 'VALUE: Joint Report Review & Reconciliation'. A 'Reverse Trial' badge is visible, showing it happens during the free period. Stage 4 \(Monetization & Loop Reset\): A combination icon of a \
credit card/subscription \(Monetization\) and an outgoing ripple effect \(Growth\). Text: 'OUTCOME: Paid Subscription Start \(Both Users Activated\)' and smaller text: 'Accountant is Introduced to FinWise workflow'. An arrow completes the loop back toward\
 a new 'Trigger' \(perhaps a small cluster of new client logos waiting to sign up\). In the center of the loop, a stylized circle is labeled 'THE COLLABORATION LOOP' with sub-text: '1 Trial User = 2+ Retained Users'. The overall aesthetic is airy and digi\
tally crisp. The background is a clean white canvas with abstract geometric shapes and light data streams. All vector figures are diverse and professional. The entire diagram is contained within a subtly glowing light blue border., AI generated, AI genera\
ted)/K 7/P 1031 0 R/Pg 14 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
